  "_comment": "In-battle Kamcord toggles. Share (28) one-hit-kills enemies via DebugManager.enableTestZClass (+0x25). StartRec (30) freezes the turn timer via higeTest (+0x11). StopRec (29) toggles party invincibility via higeMiniTest (+0x12) -> TutorialManager.SetMutekiFlag -> Entity.isMuteki. All three survive the Everyplay gate and the StartBattle disable flags, re-colour red/white when the menu reopens, and persist across restarts as a bitmask under the version-verifier literal (the Everyplay key cannot be used: its 0/1 setter wipes the mask at the title).",
